                                                "sense_id": "2e736295-4f29-385e-aad7-6bc2d5e04779",
                                                "text": "Microsoft, Pfizer and JP Morgan Chase have set up offices in the country, a streamlined visa program has incentivized thousands of digital nomads to relocate to Athens, and a relentless tourism push — “You will want to stay forever!” runs the tagline — has lured a record number of Americans to the Aegean this summer."
